 instruction: "Read the text below and complete it with suitable words given in the box.",
 q: "Responsibility is a cornerstone ____ a mature and ethical character. It means being accountable ____ our actions and decisions, regardless ____ the outcome. A responsible person understands their duty ____ their family, community, and the larger society. This quality is crucial ____ personal and professional success, as it builds ____ and reliability. When faced ____ difficult situations, a person with strong responsibility does not shy ____, but actively seeks solutions. Instilling a sense ____ civic responsibility in youth is vital ____ creating a just and sustainable future.",
