 instruction: "Read the text below and complete it with suitable words given in the box.",
 q: "Artificial Intelligence (AI) is rapidly transforming various sectors ____ healthcare to finance, representing a major technological ____. Its capacity to process vast amounts of data and identify ____ beyond human perception has led ____ unprecedented efficiencies. However, the rise of AI also poses significant ethical ____, especially concerning job displacement and algorithmic bias. Ensuring that AI systems are developed and deployed ____ transparency and fairness is paramount ____ mitigating these risks. Furthermore, global ____ on the responsible use of AI is essential ____ shaping its trajectory and maximizing its potential ____ the benefit of humanity.",
 type: "Blank-Type-A",
