 q: "Duty and responsibility are two core ethical ____ that shape an individual's contribution ____ society. Fulfilling one's duty means performing obligations, regardless ____ personal inconvenience, while responsibility goes ____ that, encompassing accountability ____ one's choices. A person who acts ____ a strong sense of duty and responsibility earns the ____ of others and contributes ____ the smooth functioning of their community. This adherence ____ moral principles is not only essential for social harmony but also builds personal integrity. We must consciously cultivate these values ____ our youth to ensure a resilient and ethical future.",
