    "q": "$\\tan\\theta = \\sqrt{3}$ হলে—<br>i. $\\sin 2\\theta = \\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$<br>ii. $\\cos 2\\theta = -\\frac{1}{2}$<br>iii. $\\tan 2\\theta = -\\sqrt{3}$<br><br>নিচের কোনটি সঠিক?",
    "type": "MCQ",
